<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 3,595 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 3,595 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 3,595.00 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,584.99 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 25		 Sept 24</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,595.00		3,584.99</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.50		    1.76</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
